        An org-side FieldPermissions row for Task.WhoId (Broker_Protection_Access, read+edit) was
        created directly in the org on 2026-08-01 to unblock the live inbound-email pipeline (the
        Email Service context user, Minimum Access profile, could not see Task.WhoId when the
        pipeline logs an inbound-email Task). Re-verify this row after every deploy of this
        permission set via:
          SELECT Id FROM FieldPermissions WHERE Parent.Name='Broker_Protection_Access'
            AND SobjectType='Task' AND Field='Task.WhoId'
        If a future deploy of this file is confirmed NOT to clear the org-side WhoId row, this
        comment can be replaced with a real <fieldPermissions> block — do not add one speculatively
        without confirming Task.WhoId deploys cleanly via metadata first.
    -->
